  "id": "USN-8290-1",
  "summary": "node-path-to-regexp vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that Path-to-Regexp incorrectly handled route patterns\ncontaining multiple named parameters separated by non-delimiter characters\nsuch as hyphens. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial\nof service via catastrophic backtracking in the generated regular expressions.",
